# w80d, "allow players to release permanent cards anywhere, but if they release it in an invalid location,
# just have the card land in the next avaliable board space." Seat 0 holds two free creatures and a land
# with its land drop unused, and already has a creature and two lands down, so a row's next space is not
# its first. `e2e/w80d-release-anywhere.spec.ts` releases each one away from its own battlefield.
